   <title>org.osgi.service.event.propertytypes</title>
   <info>
      <releaseinfo xml:id="org.osgi.service.event.propertytypes-version">Version 1.4</releaseinfo>
      <edition xml:id="org.osgi.service.event.propertytypes-version.number">1.4</edition>
   </info>
   <para>
Event Admin Component Property Types Package Version 1.4.
 </para>
   <para>
 When used as annotations, component property types are processed by tools to
 generate Component Descriptions which are used at runtime.
 </para>
   <para>
 Bundles wishing to use this package at runtime must list the package in the
 Import-Package header of the bundle's manifest.
 </para>
   <para>
 Example import for consumers using the API in this package:
 </para>
   <para>
 {@code  Import-Package: org.osgi.service.event.propertytypes; version="[1.4,2.0)"}</para>
